REMARK   0 Regression fixture for cross-model chain selection.
REMARK   0 Model 1 has ONLY chain A. Model 2 has chain A (shifted +10 in x) AND
REMARK   0 chain B. pdbtbx PDB.chains() flattens across all models, so a naive
REMARK   0 chain search could return model 2's chain B (or model 2's chain A).
REMARK   0 Supervision must select from model 1: chain A's CA(ALA) at x=2.0, and
REMARK   0 must RAISE for chain B (absent from model 1), not silently use model 2.
MODEL        1
ATOM      1  N   ALA A   1       1.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM      2  CA  ALA A   1       2.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      3  C   ALA A   1       3.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      4  O   ALA A   1       3.000   2.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM      5  N   GLY A   2       4.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM      6  CA  GLY A   2       5.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      7  C   GLY A   2       6.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM      8  O   GLY A   2       6.000   2.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ENDMDL
MODEL        2
ATOM      9  N   ALA A   1      11.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM     10  CA  ALA A   1      12.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     11  C   ALA A   1      13.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     12  O   ALA A   1      13.000   2.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM     13  N   GLY A   2      14.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM     14  CA  GLY A   2      15.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     15  C   GLY A   2      16.000   1.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     16  O   GLY A   2      16.000   2.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM     17  N   ALA B   1      11.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM     18  CA  ALA B   1      12.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     19  C   ALA B   1      13.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     20  O   ALA B   1      13.000   6.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ATOM     21  N   GLY B   2      14.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           N
ATOM     22  CA  GLY B   2      15.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     23  C   GLY B   2      16.000   5.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           C
ATOM     24  O   GLY B   2      16.000   6.000   1.000  1.00  0.00           O
ENDMDL
END
